    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Uncover the immense potential of this West Cork property, commanding beautiful elevated views over Red Strand and the Atlantic Ocean.\nMoments from golden sands of Red Strand Beach, Galley Head lighthouse and the wooded trails of Castlefreke. \n\nThis 4 bedroom bungalow residence extends to c. 130 Sqm or 1400 sqft plus adjacent garage on a plot of 0.214 acres. \nBring your vision as it requires a full renovation but should qualify for the Vacant homes and SEAI grants as it has been vacant for several years.\n\nThe property is situated alongside a working farm, 12 mins drive to the stunning village of Rosscarbery, 15 min drive from the multi award winning Clonakilty, 1 hour drive from Cork City International airport. The popular Fishers Cross pub is 1 mile away and Ardfield village is 2 miles away.\n\n\nAccommodation c. 103 m²/ 1400 ft² \n\nPorch into entrance hall \nWith fitted storage.\n\nSitting room 6.5 m x 2.5 m & 1.9 m x 1.8 m \nFantastic views and light from the windows facing south and west with views of the sea and Red Strand beach. Fireplace.\n\nKitchen 5.9 m x 3.3 m \nWith door out to utility and window facing West with views out towards the sea. Fitted units here.\n\nUtility room 4.6 m x 2.4 m \nDoor to the side and door to the garage.\nThere is fitted unit units here.\n\nAttached garage 7.2 m x 3.6 m & 2.6 m x 2.5 m\nRoller door and pedestrian door. There is internal access from the utility room also.\n\nBedroom One 3.3 m x 3.3 m \nDouble bedroom with fitted storage and superb views out to the sea and Red Strand beach\n\nBedroom Two 3.3 m x 3.8 m \nDouble bedroom with fitted storage and superb views out to the sea and Red Strand beach\n\nBedroom three 3.3 m x 4 m\nDouble bedroom with fitted storage\n\nBathroom 1.9 m x 3.3 m \nBath, wash hand basin and toilet WC\n\nBedroom four 3.6 m 3.3 m \nDouble bedroom with fitted storage\n\nServices\nMains water connection. Septic tank with registered right of way access.\nHeating via oil fired central heating and open fire.\nDouble glazed windows\n\nOutbuildings\nDetached steel frame garage c. 25 Sqm. Connection for power."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Stunning vistas with panoramic views of Red Strand beach and the Atlantic Ocean </li><li> A short distance from Galley Head Lighthouse, Castlefreke walking trails and Long Strand </li><li> Minutes from the villages of Rosscarbery, Ardfield and Rathbarry and the Fish Basket café </li><li> A short drive to both Rosscarbery and Clonakilty </li><li> 4 bed bungalow residence c. 1400 Sqft plus garage </li><li> Should qualify for the Vacant Homes/SEAI grants</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: G<br>Energy Performance Indicator: 655.69 kWh/m2/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "For directions type Eircode P85 VY51 into smart phone.\nFrom Clonakilty drive south towards Ardfield village and continue on past until you get to Red Strand beach. From Red Strand beach head west towards Galley Head and after ½ km turn right, Take the first turning to the right and continue to the end of this road where the property is on the left."
      },
      {
